---
---

<footer class="w-full overflow-hidden mt-auto border-t border-[#dfd8d4] bg-[#eae4e1] py-8 sm:py-12">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col gap-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      {/* Brand & mission */}
      <div class="md:col-span-2 flex flex-col items-start gap-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <a href="/" class="text-base font-black text-[#1c1917] tracking-tight hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">Grid<span class="text-[#19C37D]">ika</span></a>
          <span class="text-xs text-[#a8a29e]">•</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-[#57534e] font-bold">3D-эффекты для любого сайта</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#78716c] font-medium leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          Автономный клиентский WebGL рендеринг без серверов. 100% считываемость QR-кодов, высокая производительность и быстрая установка на Tilda, WordPress, Webflow и Wix.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* 3D Widgets links */}
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-[#1c1917]">3D-виджеты</h4>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#57534e]">
          <li><a href="/3d-qr-code/" class="hover:text-[#19C37D] transition-colors">3D QR-код</a></li>
          <li><a href="/3d-card/" class="hover:text-[#19C37D] transition-colors">3D-визитка с QR</a></li>
          <li><a href="/promo-gift/" class="hover:text-[#19C37D] transition-colors">Подарок с промокодом</a></li>
          <li><a href="/voxels/" class="hover:text-[#19C37D] transition-colors">Воксели и 3D-логотипы</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Guides & Platforms */}
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-[#1c1917]">Интеграции и база</h4>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#57534e]">
          <li><a href="/guide" class="hover:text-[#19C37D] transition-colors">Интеграция с Tilda</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guide" class="hover:text-[#19C37D] transition-colors">Интерактивный гайд</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#studio" class="hover:text-[#19C37D] transition-colors">3D Студия</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#pricing" class="hover:text-[#19C37D] transition-colors">Тарифы</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Юридический блок для соблюдения требований 152-ФЗ, 54-ФЗ и банковского эквайринга */}
    <div class="border-t border-[#d8d0cb] pt-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[12px] text-[#78716c]">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-x-2.5 sm:gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-center md:text-left">
        <a href="mailto:support@gridika.ru" class="text-[#132A22] font-semibold hover:text-[#19C37D] transition-colors">support@gridika.ru</a>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-2.5 sm:gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5 text-center font-semibold text-[#57534e]">
        <a href="/offer" class="hover:text-[#19C37D] transition-colors">Публичная оферта</a>
        <span class="text-[#a8a29e] hidden sm:inline">•</span>
        <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-[#19C37D] transition-colors">Политика конфиденциальности</a>
        <span class="text-[#a8a29e] hidden sm:inline">•</span>
        <button type="button" onclick="window.openCookieSettings?.()" class="hover:text-[#19C37D] transition-colors cursor-pointer">Cookies</button>
        <span class="text-[#a8a29e] hidden sm:inline">•</span>
        <span class="text-[#a8a29e]">© 2026 Gridika</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
